                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a2e4161-3897-3b8b-a1f6-edec5ea357d7",
                        "entry_id": "06a5d52b-0a94-3da0-b953-d53920971e87",
                        "glosses": [
                            "быть благодетелем, оказывать благодеяния кому-либо"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "888712d9-917b-4a52-857d-b9d06f5a3132",
                                "sense_id": "3a2e4161-3897-3b8b-a1f6-edec5ea357d7",
                                "text": "Открытие это было нож в сердце доктору. Его и прежде тяготила помощь Анфима Ефимовича. Теперь стеснительность этих одолжений осложнялась другими ощущениями. Едва ли Анфим благодетельствует Ларисе Фёдоровне ради её прекрасных глаз. Юрий Андреевич представил себе свободные манеры Анфима Ефимовича и Ларину женскую опрометчивость. Не может быть, чтобы между ними ничего не было."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3d42bc6d-7f9f-4fed-94ef-372418b38ea1",
                        "source_entry_id": "06a5d52b-0a94-3da0-b953-d53920971e87",
                        "source_sense_id": "3a2e4161-3897-3b8b-a1f6-edec5ea357d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "benefit",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "benefit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "858008d0-ca0a-39bb-af71-0840101c8517",
                                        "entry_id": "7f5d137d-6638-3719-a9d0-06ff8890afdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An advantage; help or aid from something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e91a193f-0baa-416b-a6f0-a50246d8a5b3",
                                                "sense_id": "858008d0-ca0a-39bb-af71-0840101c8517",
                                                "text": "For the trip over the grass-covered sleepers and between the cow-parsley and briars, an open wagon was added to the usual combination of locomotive and coach, for the benefit of those who wanted to take photographs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09ec4b97-5943-4cdc-81a9-5650247f8387",
                                                "sense_id": "858008d0-ca0a-39bb-af71-0840101c8517",
                                                "text": "She can't read, so the voice recording was made for her benefit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ad04023-f38b-424d-9190-56061dab347c",
                                                "sense_id": "858008d0-ca0a-39bb-af71-0840101c8517",
                                                "text": "Exposure to cutting-edge technologies is one of the benefits of the job."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5194d7aa-0b5f-4388-9e2b-14c08c3020fd",
                                                "sense_id": "858008d0-ca0a-39bb-af71-0840101c8517",
                                                "text": "When this conversation was repeated in detail within the hearing of the young woman in question, and undoubtedly for his benefit, Mr. Trevor threw shame to the winds and scandalized the Misses Brewster then and there by proclaiming his father to have been a country storekeeper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f10882f-09b1-33aa-9103-73d0e9ec4762",
                                        "entry_id": "7f5d137d-6638-3719-a9d0-06ff8890afdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A payment made in accordance with an insurance policy or a public assistance scheme."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ccd8618e-19b3-39c1-9e12-8643c7755d89",
                                        "entry_id": "7f5d137d-6638-3719-a9d0-06ff8890afdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An event, such as a theatrical performance, given to raise funds for some cause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "baa122c9-7f73-48bf-9b96-3daae8f89c12",
                                                "sense_id": "ccd8618e-19b3-39c1-9e12-8643c7755d89",
                                                "text": "Gore Vidal […] will be sharing his wit and wisdom at the Arlington Street Church on Wednesday, April 5th at 7:00. The appearance is a benefit for the Boston/Boise Committee and the tickets are priced at $5."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fcc184fc-224b-3c8e-8307-b68f3216a827",
                                        "entry_id": "7f5d137d-6638-3719-a9d0-06ff8890afdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "beneficence; liberality"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0650f1e5-c287-463a-a03c-b110d4745b57",
                                                "sense_id": "fcc184fc-224b-3c8e-8307-b68f3216a827",
                                                "text": "The Birds, that liue i'th field / On the vvilde Benefit of nature, liue / Happier then vve; for they may chooſe their Mates, / And carroll their ſvveet pleaſures to the Spring: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0946c7e5-c340-34a8-8941-54195d38d74b",
                                        "entry_id": "7f5d137d-6638-3719-a9d0-06ff8890afdd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Intended audience (as for the benefit of)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "754b1e02-1ffe-40a3-8660-c50506af9a4d",
                                                "sense_id": "0946c7e5-c340-34a8-8941-54195d38d74b",
                                                "text": "The whole scene was staged for his benefit, and it completely fooled him."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b465affb-3c01-4fc0-b6d0-9fe3c587ef73",
                                                "sense_id": "0946c7e5-c340-34a8-8941-54195d38d74b",
                                                "text": "Since my wife is Canadian, whenever we have dinner with my family, they keep bringing up anything they've heard about Canada lately for her benefit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "672ca6ca-9c22-41c1-95bc-e873936778c9",
                                                "sense_id": "0946c7e5-c340-34a8-8941-54195d38d74b",
                                                "text": "So, if Obodzinski is correct in saying that Mrs. Piela actually signed a document in the coffee shop, in front of witnesses, she staged a scene, pretending that it was the alleged Mandate. The other explanation is that none of this ever took place, and the staging was only a fictitious creation for the benefit of the Court."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "benefit",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a571d714-c29d-32b8-87a4-cdb48e2a20db",
                                        "entry_id": "c2637482-66f1-328a-b2de-ea7c3b15a2fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be or to provide a benefit to."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cac4c75-3618-4cd4-b6e1-a2f6475badb7",
                                                "sense_id": "a571d714-c29d-32b8-87a4-cdb48e2a20db",
                                                "text": "[…] I will repent of the good; wherewith I saide I would benefite them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f534a2a2-f742-40bf-8746-2039ab913da0",
                                                "sense_id": "a571d714-c29d-32b8-87a4-cdb48e2a20db",
                                                "text": "The spending in and around local stations is creating micro-economies that are benefiting Great Britain's high streets, independent businesses and economic growth, both locally and on a national level."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63662f0d-828a-3241-a2a3-ec364fecdd6d",
                                        "entry_id": "c2637482-66f1-328a-b2de-ea7c3b15a2fa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To receive a benefit (from); to be a beneficiary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33f08014-2ca4-4f79-8746-f958dcd717b2",
                                                "sense_id": "63662f0d-828a-3241-a2a3-ec364fecdd6d",
                                                "text": "Diesel maintenance schedules are benefiting from work done on the magnificent Hilger & Watts electronic spectrograph for oil analysis, which detects minute quantities of metals in samples of used lubricating oil; [...]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d97a7b64-c383-42ee-b7b8-31e4d332d5eb",
                                                "sense_id": "63662f0d-828a-3241-a2a3-ec364fecdd6d",
                                                "text": "Although some apeirophobics have benefitted from treatments like medication and cognitive behavioral therapy, others have found no way to mitigate the existential terror."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d397c8f9-2255-482c-a246-fa9d5087f257",
                                                "sense_id": "63662f0d-828a-3241-a2a3-ec364fecdd6d",
                                                "text": "Instead, the grime of the steam years which still discoloured many of the best architectural features Betjeman loved has been cleared away, and several of the stations have benefited from major refurbishments which have greatly improved them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b59e23cf-a4e4-4453-ba3f-80e700c2b4f3",
                                                "sense_id": "63662f0d-828a-3241-a2a3-ec364fecdd6d",
                                                "text": "Although Katy has admitted to being bi-curious in the past, the reason a lot of fans wanted clarity on her sexuality was to ensure she wasn't queer-baiting and benefiting from a culture she isn't actually part of."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c8eaefe2-b892-415c-b93f-e180b6da6acc",
                        "source_entry_id": "06a5d52b-0a94-3da0-b953-d53920971e87",
                        "source_sense_id": "3a2e4161-3897-3b8b-a1f6-edec5ea357d7",
                        "target_lang_word": "bénéficier",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bénéficier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb4c5301-f2ba-3728-a1fd-85468c5705ca",
                                        "entry_id": "d2e4b559-8578-3b2f-82ac-89f386882126",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Tirer avantage, profit ou plus-value de quelque chose ; profiter (de)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a08cab3c-706d-4773-a0d1-d355bd3586f5",
                                                "sense_id": "fb4c5301-f2ba-3728-a1fd-85468c5705ca",
                                                "text": "M. Berteaux. — Messieurs, cette année le 14 juillet tombe un dimanche, et cette coïncidence prive d'un jour de congé un grand nombre de personnes qui en bénéficiaient habituellement à l'occasion de la fête nationale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3bfec30-aca3-49aa-91b5-2c1f665668e6",
                                                "sense_id": "fb4c5301-f2ba-3728-a1fd-85468c5705ca",
                                                "text": "Peu de chefs religieux bénéficient d’une réputation aussi enviable que celle de Tenzin Gyasto, chef spirituel et temporel du Tibet bouddhiste, qui se fait aussi appeler Sa Sainteté le dalaï-lama."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64f279dc-fd18-472d-8c20-76cf675cc5bf",
                                                "sense_id": "fb4c5301-f2ba-3728-a1fd-85468c5705ca",
                                                "text": "La production des témoins ayant bénéficié de la fumure azotée était la plus élevée, que ce soit sur sol acide ou sur vertisol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33295996-754c-4212-88b3-d5f6a2c7af06",
                                                "sense_id": "fb4c5301-f2ba-3728-a1fd-85468c5705ca",
                                                "text": "L’amîn est celui dont l’écriture, dans les contrats, actes et autres documents, fait foi. Il doit donc bénéficier de la confiance de toutes les parties."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "01ab626b-4784-3968-8645-255733774ff3",
                                        "entry_id": "d2e4b559-8578-3b2f-82ac-89f386882126",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Donner un profit à quelqu’un ou à quelque chose, profiter (à)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "note": "Dans ce sens, le sujet est un objet, et le verbe est alors suivi de la préposition à",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e38fc428-a9ea-4c0e-be0a-ae4683e9288c",
                                                "sense_id": "01ab626b-4784-3968-8645-255733774ff3",
                                                "text": "Le 4 thermidor, dans une mémorable séance de la Convention, je l’entendis interrompre brusquement la discussion d’un projet de loi tendant à éloigner de Paris ceux qui réclamaient leur radiation sur la liste des émigrés. Le Gendre assura qu’il ne prétendait pas que des radiations bénéficiassent à des émigrés, ennemis de la patrie, portant les armes contre elle; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27f5e2f0-1339-4c7b-9623-6803ba1b2abb",
                                                "sense_id": "01ab626b-4784-3968-8645-255733774ff3",
                                                "text": "Parallèlement au traitement curatif, l'administration pratiquait une politique d'alimentation. Elle contraignait les gens à se nourrir mieux et plus, les aidant dans l'établissement des cultures, veillant à ce que les récoltes bénéficiassent à tous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65d50416-6bca-44d2-8d8e-34b0b1d3e838",
                                                "sense_id": "01ab626b-4784-3968-8645-255733774ff3",
                                                "text": "Il importait qu'elle bénéficiât à tous les Canadiens français dans le cadre des accords culturels conclus à cet effet, ceux-ci recevant une large application par les voies officielles, à l'exclusion de toutes autres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5578fac5-20ce-4e55-83fa-6c9cc5967e07",
                                                "sense_id": "01ab626b-4784-3968-8645-255733774ff3",
                                                "text": "Cette politique bénéficiera à toutes les personnes éloignées des emplois stables, donc aux femmes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "bénéficier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                        "entry_id": "08ce0376-0a91-30b5-bf74-7cd625cc32dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui avait un bénéfice ecclésiastique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52bf2347-2b41-4ad0-9da2-b0d38ed597ec",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "Plusieurs cahiers demandent la résidence de tous les bénéficiers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec5a00c6-f720-4bb7-8c61-cb785e85e884",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "Tous ces bénéficiers d’occasion prenaient ordinairement la prêtrise dans l’année de leur nomination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8c2f8a9-b4eb-42d8-aea1-6a807dc1d6fe",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "Au Moyen Âge le mot « personne » avait les sens suivants : « Curé, recteur d’une paroisse » ou « Bénéficier ecclésiastique : Chanoines, chapelains, personnes, Moines nouviaus de toutes gonnes »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9aaaa79-f803-4d18-8bd9-6c8c472fc52c",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "En cas d'infraction aux lois réglementaires, les bénéficiers étaient condamnés par les archidiacres à aumôner de grosses sommes à la boete des pauvres, expression souvent employée dans les ordonnances des rois de France et les arrêts du parlement."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6bc969df-a21f-4d69-977b-5910ce962eec",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "Art. 6. 1 Le bénéficier est désigné conformément au droit de l’Eglise."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26ce08a1-fac2-4f5b-b2cd-da9571aed0b3",
                                                "sense_id": "5e37a26c-98d9-3b8e-9088-8d636292ac45",
                                                "text": "Au-dessous encore existaient d’autres assemblées : celles des vicaires, des centeniers ; que dis-je, les moindres bénéficiers, les intendants des fermes royales, tenaient des plaids comme les comtes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
